* {{MacroLink|Icon=AliasForTableForObject.png|Macro_Alias_For_Table_For_Object|Macro Alias For Table For Object}}: Automatically creates aliases in a two-dimensional table using the names of the rows and columns. A second function can create a link between a cell and a property value of an object. Just place the name of the relevant object in the column and the name of the property in the row.
