<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{MacroLink|Icon=Macro_SpreadsheetTools.png|Macro_SpreadsheetTools|Macro Spreadsheet Tools}}: This macro helps managing cells inside FreeCAD Spreadsheet workbench.
